  "limits": [
    "Whole positive cgroup resource-domain integration tests were not run: this uid has no preconfigured empty delegated leaf, migration permission or required enabled controller files. Both explicit ignored tests remain pending; compiled/ignored is not a passed resource-domain acceptance.",
    "Actual affinity-before-exec and multi-thread inheritance, pre-exec failure, real cgroupfs lease behavior and fake-directory rejection were exercised. These component results do not substitute for whole positive cgroup startup.",
    "Resource acquisition and observation use cooperative advisory leases; a trusted deployment owner must prevent noncooperating external migration/controller changes.",
    "Allowed CPU sets and one cpuset NUMA node do not establish exclusive core isolation, page migration, locked memory, or latency qualification. memory.max is charged memory and may transiently be exceeded; parent-created sealed ELF and SHM remain charged to the parent retained budget.",
    "Failure in pre_exec prevents the target ELF from running. Post-exec observation failure kills/waits only the directly created Child, so that target may already have executed; unknown members are never killed.",
    "Observations are cold bounded samples, not continuous guarantees or global configuration Applied/release authorization. Actual global consumers, fresh authenticated provider and persistent source watermarks are still incomplete.",
    "Native WSL2 Linux with local loopback exchange fixtures, not live Binance. Docker check-linux.sh environment, older-kernel branches and non-Linux stubs were not exercised.",
    "No TLC runs, model updates or historical lock changes; final formal verification remains deferred until functional development is complete."
  ]
